<title>CANADA: Canada April petroleum product sales rise 6.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada April petroleum product sales rise 6.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Canada on Monday issued the following data for sales of refined petroleum products:</p>
<p>PETROLEUM PRODUCT SALES (thousands of cubic meters)</p>
<p>				    Apr 1997     Apr 1996	 pct</p>
<p>   Total sales		  6,911.2	6,488.3	 +6.5</p>
<p>   Motor gasoline	     2,855.4	2,816.3	 +1.4</p>
<p>   Diesel fuel		  1,533.5	1,397.7	 +9.7</p>
<p>   Light fuel oil		 487.0	  487.5	 -0.1</p>
<p>   Heavy fuel oil		 504.4	  362.7	+39.1</p>
<p>   Aviation turbo fuels	 442.5	  416.3	 +6.3</p>
<p>   Petrochemical feedstocks   392.4	  330.8	+18.6</p>
<p>   All other products	   696.0	  677.0	 +2.8</p>
<p>(For more information from Statistics Canada, contact David Roeske, Energy Section, (613) 951-3563.)</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau (613) 235-6745))</p>
</text>
